     "html": "<h2>Hey {{ contact.firstname }},</h2>\n<div>\n<div data-hs-cos-general-type=\"widget\" data-hs-cos-type=\"module\">\n<div data-hs-cos-general-type=\"widget\" data-hs-cos-type=\"rich_text\">\n<p><br>Your patients are already talking about bloating, brain fog, immunity, and mood. What they\u2019re really asking is: <em>\u201cWhat\u2019s the plan?\u201d</em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>The <strong>5R Framework</strong> gives you that plan in five clinically sequenced steps you can plug straight into your existing <span style=\"background:#FFF3CD;border-bottom:2px solid #8A6300;\" data-praxera-review=\"brand\">Praxera</span> or branded line.&nbsp;<br><br>We sent this protocol to you a few weeks ago, but didn't get into the nitty-gritty ... And this one is important enough to deserve its solo&nbsp;moment in the limelight.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #6ca439;\"><strong>The 5Rs, at a glance:</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Remove</strong> \u2013 Target unwanted pathogens, yeasts, and bacteria driving dysbiosis.*</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Replace</strong> \u2013 Support digestive enzymes so patients actually absorb what they eat.*</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Reinoculate</strong> \u2013 Rebuild healthy flora with high-quality probiotics, at the right time.*</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Repair</strong> \u2013 Soothe and restore gut lining integrity to calm upstream signals.*</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Rebalance</strong> \u2013 Support the gut-brain axis to lock in results and reduce relapse.*</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>When you stock the 5Rs in-office (or under your own brand), you get:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p style=\"font-weight: normal;\">A clear framework instead of one-off product guesses</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Higher compliance because patients understand the sequence</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Built-in education tools you can customize with your branding</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>\ud83d\udc49 <a href=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/5Rs-Design-B%20(1).pdf\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\" rel=\"noopener\" data-hs-domain-rewrite=\"true\"><strong>Download the 5R Framework Quick Deploy Kit</strong></a> to see the full protocol map, suggested <span style=\"background:#FFF3CD;border-bottom:2px solid #8A6300;\" data-praxera-review=\"brand\">Praxera</span> SKUs, and ways to bundle it&nbsp;under your own label.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
